OL,3,AArrest made after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,Amountaintop Eagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in the southern German state of
OL,7,FBavaria have detained a suspect during
OL,8,Fa fire at Adolf Hitler's Alpine
OL,9,Fmountain retreat, the Kehlsteinhaus,
OL,10,Falso known as the Eagle's Nest.
OL,12,FDispatchers in Traunstein received a
OL,13,Ffire alarm from the building at 21:15
OL,14,Flocal time (19:15 GMT) on Friday and
OL,15,Ffirefighters found it engulfed in
OL,16,Fflames.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
